{"channelId":"UCpSKESABFjeGPRASVH0qtTg","row":["Emma Turner Sports Massage Therapy",9,"As an experienced, mobile Sports Massage Therapist, I visit your home, workplace or sports venue. I treat people of all ages and backgrounds (not just sports people!), whose conditions or symptoms may arise from over use, injury, surgery, degenerative conditions and neurological disorders, to name just a few. If you are experiencing pain, discomfort, reduced mobility, have an injury or want to improve personal performance, contact me to discuss your condition and see how I can help. I am  based in Rugby, Warwickshire. I use manual therapy, soft tissue techniques and movement education to aid your recovery and my goal is to empower you to control/eradicate your condition by identifying and treating the cause, not just the symptom. Self-care has never been more important.  Learn to stretch, strengthen, relax and use self massage techniques, as you begin to understand what is happening to your body.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpSKESABFjeGPRASVH0qtTg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpSKESABFjeGPRASVH0qtTg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:53.343Z","channelId":"UCpSKESABFjeGPRASVH0qtTg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"df73e30672370c0e8e7c2428cefa56dfaa17183326fa3b4aa07eb00b1e24d57c","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"e491ddc135fe2e448dd0f3148fe6aeaf06e8f24e5a959755eae35d25a73878ef"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpSKESABFjeGPRASVH0qtTg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":9,"raw":"9 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpSKESABFjeGPRASVH0qtTg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:53.343Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["massage therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["massage therapist"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLeve